    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2575370/extras/4681e244f3b2ce9b2796039c4f4291ca.poster.avif?t=1754772620\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2575370/extras/4681e244f3b2ce9b2796039c4f4291ca.apng?t=1754772620\" class=\"bb_img\" width=396 height=114 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wildwood Down</strong> is a charming adventure about a chummy high school senior with Down syndrome who gets thrown head first into a murder mystery along the boardwalk of Wildwood, New Jersey. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With his sister's life on the line, Dan must unravel the case all while navigating eccentric characters and his own unique perspective before time runs out!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Can this unlikely hero outsmart the danger lurking beneath the cheerful fa-cade of America's favorite seaside destination?   </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u200bThe main character Daniel is voice-acted by our childhood friend / brother from another mother Daniel himself. He has down-syndrome, a fantastic sense of humor, and loves video games. If anyone deserves his own game it's this guy. <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2575370/extras/1ccc55611258b0414e258b552690adf9.poster.avif?t=1754772620\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2575370/extras/1ccc55611258b0414e258b552690adf9.webm?t=1754772620\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>\u200b</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2575370/extras/747f3f37e3566cd736ab91b550e64f3e.poster.avif?t=1754772620\" width=396 height=115 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2575370/extras/747f3f37e3566cd736ab91b550e64f3e.webm?t=1754772620\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>8-10+ hours of Story-Driven Gameplay</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Full Cast of Professional Voice Talent</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Original Soundtrack\u00a0<i>&quot;Surf Rock Noir&quot;</i> </strong>(Live Instruments)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Funny Rewarding Puzzles with Minimal <i>&quot;Moon Logic&quot;</i></strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Retro Hand Drawn frame-by-frame Pixel Art</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> Full Controller Support </strong>(Designed with Steam-Deck in mind)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cinematic 3d - Camera Work / Sound / Lighting</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> </strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>(Cheeky Puzzles add to the humorous dichotomy of the world of Wildwood Down)</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The protagonist Daniel finds himself making donuts, winning an underground wrestling tournament, and getting thrown out of bars in-order to unveil the murderer of his good friend and hopefully save his sister.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >(<strong>A Fun-tastic Coastal environment with attractive 2D/3D Art)</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The visuals are a &quot;first-in-it's-class&quot; for the P&amp;C genre. A combination of 2D pixel and 3D graphics with a unique art style that presents eye popping scenery. Wildwood Down pulls players into it's world: cinematic camera work, a 3d soundscape, full character voice acting, and rich retrograde pixel art. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>(An engaging journey with &quot;Daniel&quot; and his eccentric friends)</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Provides an immersive adventure with quirky but lovable characters full of jokes, spoofs, and other humorous scenes. Be \u2018Dan,\u2019 and unravel the sinister plot of the &quot;Boardwalk Butcher&quot; and help the high school seniors <strong>party on</strong> and <strong>save your sister!</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2575370/extras/4681e244f3b2ce9b2796039c4f4291ca.poster.avif?t=1754772620\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2575370/extras/4681e244f3b2ce9b2796039c4f4291ca.apng?t=1754772620\" class=\"bb_img\" width=396 height=114 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wildwood Down</strong> is a charming adventure about a chummy high school senior with Down syndrome who gets thrown head first into a murder mystery along the boardwalk of Wildwood, New Jersey. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With his sister's life on the line, Dan must unravel the case all while navigating eccentric characters and his own unique perspective before time runs out!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Can this unlikely hero outsmart the danger lurking beneath the cheerful fa-cade of America's favorite seaside destination?   </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u200bThe main character Daniel is voice-acted by our childhood friend / brother from another mother Daniel himself. He has down-syndrome, a fantastic sense of humor, and loves video games. If anyone deserves his own game it's this guy. <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2575370/extras/1ccc55611258b0414e258b552690adf9.poster.avif?t=1754772620\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2575370/extras/1ccc55611258b0414e258b552690adf9.webm?t=1754772620\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>\u200b</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2575370/extras/747f3f37e3566cd736ab91b550e64f3e.poster.avif?t=1754772620\" width=396 height=115 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2575370/extras/747f3f37e3566cd736ab91b550e64f3e.webm?t=1754772620\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>8-10+ hours of Story-Driven Gameplay</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Full Cast of Professional Voice Talent</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Original Soundtrack\u00a0<i>&quot;Surf Rock Noir&quot;</i> </strong>(Live Instruments)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Funny Rewarding Puzzles with Minimal <i>&quot;Moon Logic&quot;</i></strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Retro Hand Drawn frame-by-frame Pixel Art</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> Full Controller Support </strong>(Designed with Steam-Deck in mind)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cinematic 3d - Camera Work / Sound / Lighting</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> </strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>(Cheeky Puzzles add to the humorous dichotomy of the world of Wildwood Down)</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The protagonist Daniel finds himself making donuts, winning an underground wrestling tournament, and getting thrown out of bars in-order to unveil the murderer of his good friend and hopefully save his sister.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >(<strong>A Fun-tastic Coastal environment with attractive 2D/3D Art)</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The visuals are a &quot;first-in-it's-class&quot; for the P&amp;C genre. A combination of 2D pixel and 3D graphics with a unique art style that presents eye popping scenery. Wildwood Down pulls players into it's world: cinematic camera work, a 3d soundscape, full character voice acting, and rich retrograde pixel art. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>(An engaging journey with &quot;Daniel&quot; and his eccentric friends)</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Provides an immersive adventure with quirky but lovable characters full of jokes, spoofs, and other humorous scenes. Be \u2018Dan,\u2019 and unravel the sinister plot of the &quot;Boardwalk Butcher&quot; and help the high school seniors <strong>party on</strong> and <strong>save your sister!</strong></p>",
    "short_description": "Step into the hilariously twisted world of Wildwood Down, a side-splitting comedy thriller. Featuring a protagonist with Down Syndrome. (Inspired by and voice acted by the Dev's childhood friend!) Perfect for fans of the P-n-C adventure genre and new comers looking for a wild heartfelt ride!",
    "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
    "reviews": "\u201cWildwood Down is a heartfelt, hilarious point-and-click adventure that blends classic nostalgia with modern charm. Discover why it\u2019s 2025\u2019s must-play indie gem.\u201d<br>10/10 \u2013 GeekGasm<br><br>\u201cAmusingly inventive cartoon murder mystery with a standout main character is sure to leave you feeling uplifted.\u201d<br>85/100 \u2013 Adventure Game Hotspot<br>",
